# ===== Summer_26 .gitignore =====
# See repo README for the rationale.

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.pyi
*.so
*.so.*
.venv/
venv/
env/
.Python
*.egg-info/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- OS / editor cruft ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/

# --- Windows Zone.Identifier alternate data streams ---
# (created when files are downloaded from the internet on Windows)
*:Zone.Identifier
*_Zone.Identifier

# --- Nested git clones (track upstream separately) ---
# Claude_Personal_AI_ML_Class_and_Notes is its own repo, also in plewis3323/Masters.
AI_LLM_ML/Claude_Personal_AI_ML_Class_and_Notes/
# The textbook collection cloned from meerilahi/Books-Collection.
1st year physics review/Textbook files/Textbooks/

# --- Reference textbook collections (huge, not user-authored) ---
# Exclude all of 'Textbook files/' subdirs EXCEPT 'My physics Notes Folder/'
# (those are user-authored Scrivener / coding notes).
1st year physics review/Textbook files/*
!1st year physics review/Textbook files/My physics Notes Folder/
!1st year physics review/Textbook files/My physics Notes Folder/**

# Generic textbook folder patterns elsewhere in the tree
**/Textbooks/
**/textbook/
**/textbooks/

# --- Virtual machine images, datasets, archives ---
*.ova
*.vmdk
*.iso
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.root.bak

# --- Individual files >= 50 MB (GitHub warns >50 MB, blocks >100 MB) ---
# Re-evaluate periodically; can be re-added with git add -f if you really need them.
Nuc1_Nuc2/Nuc_2/an-introduction-to-quantum-field-theory_compress.pdf
1st year physics review/Fall_2025_SP_26_Sum_26_Teaching_skills/Stat Mech/Chemistry2e-WEB.pdf
1st year physics review/Fall_2025_SP_26_Sum_26_Teaching_skills/Colliders,TN,TDRs/ATLAS-TDR-031.pdf

# --- Scratch / tmp ---
*.tmp
*_tmp
*.scrvn_*_tmp
tmp/
scratch/
